    <name>hitorro-fleet-retrieval</name>
    <description>
        First hitorro-fleet member. A standalone Spring Boot service that hosts the
        full hitorro retrieval coordination runtime (RetrievalPipelineBuilder chain:
        Index -> Document -> Fixup -> Pagination -> Facet -> Summarization) with
        SearchSummary / Facet / Summarization aggregates and multi-index merging
        (CompositeSearchProvider + Score/RRF/FieldSort mergers).

        Dual mode:
          standalone  — owns its own Lucene + KV, ingests via REST
          shared      — reads pipeline-produced indexes at ${hitorro.pipelines.home}/lucene
                        and KV at ${hitorro.pipelines.home}/kv (mesh writers, retrieval reader)

        Deploys onto Orion mesh or Kubernetes alongside the mesh driver / agents.
        Same heavy-exclusion strategy as hitorro-mesh-driver-app to keep the fat
        jar small.
    </description>

